{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4SqDDKKhhGmNawZvPv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, heavy door. Its surface is worn wood, dark with age. A single iron keyhole stares back at you like an unblinking eye.*\n\n*The door does not move. The door does not speak. But you feel it waiting.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through the keyhole — carrying with it the faintest whisper of what lies beyond. The smell of dust. Of forgotten rooms. Of answers.*\n\n🔒\n\n*The keyhole darkens, then lightens, as if something on the other side just moved past.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n*Do you have what fits?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}